    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever, chills, or sweats</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No nausea, vomiting, or change in bowel habit</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Burning, frequency, urgency, and suprapubic ache; no blood in the urine, flank pain, vaginal discharge, or bleeding</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No back pain</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood steadier; no thoughts of suicide or self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

